WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
[Instrumental music] A tour of iROAR Premium.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Clemson's original registration menu changes to five clearly labeled cards.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.500
The student directory groups services and adds a search field.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:21.500
Browse example sections. Open one to review its instructor ratings and historical grade distribution.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Add sections to preview your week. Overlapping meeting times trigger a warning.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Section details and the weekly preview adapt to phone-width screens.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Get iROAR Premium at github.com/Adamruns/iroarpremium. [Music fades]
